Provenance
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project is a reimplementation of Lexical in Dart. It is a derivative
work: the data model, the JSON wire format, the command priority semantics,
and the tree-mutation algorithms were written while reading Lexical's
TypeScript source (version 0.48.0), and in several places the Dart code is a
close transliteration of it.

The rendering, input and selection layers have no upstream counterpart. The
DOM reconciler, `contenteditable` handling and browser selection code were
not ported; the Flutter equivalents were designed from scratch against the
same model.

Test fixtures under `packages/*/test/fixtures` are generated by running real
Lexical (`tool/fixtures/gen_fixtures.mjs`). The documents they contain were
authored for this project; the canonical form they are normalized into is
produced by upstream code at generation time.

